# ---------- audit / agent scratch ----------
# Ad-hoc security probes are written into the SQL test directory during audits.
# They are throwaway reproductions, not regression tests: a confirmed finding
# graduates into a named `*_authorization.rs` suite instead. Ignored so a
# `git add -A` before a release cannot publish them. Tracked probes all live in
# `crates/*/examples/` and are unaffected.
/crates/*/tests/*_probe.rs
/.audit/
/.opencode/
target-fp*/

# Local database artifacts are not source-distribution fixtures.
/testdb/
/testdb-full.bicbackup
